; ======================================================================
; compare_not_equal.vol  -  Conditional jump: numbers are different
; Purpose: Same program as compare_equal.vol but R1 = 06, so the result is 00.
; Expected screen output: 00
; ======================================================================
2005    ; 00: R0 = 05
2106    ; 02: R1 = 06
B10A    ; 04: if R1 = R0 jump to 0A
2200    ; 06: R2 = 00 (not equal)
B00E    ; 08: jump to 0E (R0 = R0 is always true)
2201    ; 0A: R2 = 01 (equal)
B00E    ; 0C: jump to 0E
32FF    ; 0E: screen <- R2
C000    ; 10: halt
